+        {
+            // EE-side RPC servers live in the runtime, not in IOP memory, so there is no
+            // server descriptor to point at. Drivers (e.g. Capcom's SNDDRV binding to the
+            // game's 0x77777779) loop until client->server (offset 0x24) is non-zero before
